# Recipe: content with no source file of its own.  The name "font/CascadiaMono/16" is this
# file's path under content/ minus the extension; "kind" is what it cooks to, which decides
# the cooked file name (font -> font/CascadiaMono/16.orb_font).  The remaining lines are the
# bake inputs (see config/fonts.manifest for the font_tool flags they stand for).

kind    font
face    CascadiaMono
size    16
